    "correctAnswerText": "60.39 km/h",
    "explanation": "For equal distances, the average speed is given by the Harmonic Mean formula: 2xy / (x + y) = 2 * 52 * 72 / (124) = 60.39 km/h.",
    "difficulty": "Hard"
