    "explanation": "Interest for 2 years (5 yrs - 3 yrs) = (6500 + 1000) - (5000 + 1000) = Rs. 1500.\nAnnual interest = 1500 / 2 = Rs. 750.\nPrincipal = Amount after 3 years - (3 * 750) = Rs. 3750.",
