    "questionText": "A worker's salary was increased by 15%, and subsequently reduced by 15%. What is the net percentage change in his salary?",
    "options": {
      "A": "No change (0%)",
      "B": "An increase of 2.25%",
      "C": "A decrease of 2.25%",
      "D": "A decrease of 15%"
    },
    "correctAnswer": "C",
    "correctAnswerText": "A decrease of 2.25%",
    "explanation": "When a quantity is increased by x% and then decreased by x%, the net result is always a decrease of (x^2 / 100)%: (15)^2 / 100 = 2.25% decrease.",
    "difficulty": "Hard"
